   </table><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Extreme Networks Reports First Quarter Fiscal Year 2027 Financial Results</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Revenue climbs 10% on seven straight quarters of double-digit growth</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:8.040000000000001pt;margin-top:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Strong Extreme Platform ONE</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:super;font-size:8.040000000000001pt;line-height:1.5;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">TM</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> Bookings help drive SaaS ARR growth up 22%</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Morrisville, NC, October 28, 2026</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> -- Extreme Networks, Inc. (&#x201c;Extreme&#x201d;) (Nasdaq: EXTR) today released financial results for its first quarter ended September 30, 2026.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201c;Extreme delivered its seventh consecutive quarter of double-digit year-over-year growth in Q1. Demand for Extreme Platform ONE continues to accelerate, with strong quarter-over-quarter subscription gains. Platform ONE bookings are now over 50% of subscription bookings, up 5x from the prior year. Based on the strength of our business and visibility of demand for our solutions, we are confident in calling 10% growth next quarter and for the rest of the year. The combination of our unique enterprise fabric solution, our differentiated Wi-Fi 7 offerings, and the most modern agentic AI management platform is giving us an advantage in the marketplace,&#x201d; said Ed Meyercord, President and CEO of Extreme.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#x201c;The release of our second-generation AI platform, Agent ONE Coworker, marks our shift from conversational to ambient AI. This context-aware, proactive agentic AI management platform is the most advanced in the industry. Within the first month of availability, customer engagement was roughly 10x that of our first-generation conversational AI platform. We are making it easy for our customers to take advantage of new AI capabilities in networking,&#x201d; Meyercord continued.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Kevin Rhodes, Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer, noted, &#x201c;Our SaaS ARR accelerated to 22% year-over-year growth, based on strong customer adoption of Extreme Platform ONE. Fiscal 2027 got off to a better than seasonal start, and we expect to sustain this level of growth through the year. The supply chain actions we have taken allow us to take more measured, targeted pricing actions than our competitors, while offsetting the incremental supply chain costs the industry is facing. Adjusted EBITDA grew 47% year-over-year fueling 50% non-GAAP EPS growth in Q1. These trends are adding to our confidence in the growth of cash flow and earnings going forward.&#x201d;</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">  </font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Fiscal First Quarter Results:</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">  </font></p><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Revenue $341.1 million, up 10% year-over-year</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">SaaS ARR $264.7 million, up 22% year-over-year</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">GAAP diluted EPS $0.12, up 200% year-over-year</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Non-GAAP diluted EPS $0.33, up 50% year-over-year</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">GAAP gross margin 62.1%, compared to 60.6% last year</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Non-GAAP gross margin 62.6%, compared to 61.3% last year </font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">GAAP operating profit margin 6.8%, compared to 3.6% last year</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Non-GAAP operating margin 17.4%, compared to 13.3% last year</font></div></div></div>
